<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1833847964"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1608184381"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="春を待つ (feat. 倚水)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Islet / 倚水"/><amll:meta key="album" value="春を待つ (feat. 倚水)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:46.523"><div begin="00:00.440" end="03:46.563"><p begin="00:00.440" end="00:03.368" itunes:key="L10629">僅かな命だと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你动摇颤抖地跟我说</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa zu ka na i no chi da to ha na su</span></p><p begin="00:03.378" end="00:07.260" itunes:key="L10630">話すあなたの目が揺らいだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">余命已剩不多</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no me ga yu ra i da</span></p><p begin="00:07.270" end="00:13.438" itunes:key="L10631">緩やかに 確かに 時が過ぎる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时间在缓慢 确切地流逝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ru ya ka ni ta shi ka ni to ki ga su gi ru</span></p><p begin="00:14.238" end="00:17.653" itunes:key="L10632">虚ろな日々を綴っている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">编织出这段空洞的时光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u tsu ro na hi bi wo tsu zu 't te i ru</span></p><p begin="00:17.663" end="00:21.006" itunes:key="L10633">冷え切ったその手を握っても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管握起你那冰冷的双手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi e ki 't ta so no te wo ni gi 't te mo</span></p><p begin="00:21.016" end="00:27.000" itunes:key="L10634">乾いた咳嗽が 静まることはなかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘶哑的咳嗽声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa i ta ga i so u ga</span></p><p begin="00:28.196" end="00:33.027" itunes:key="L10635">明日が見えなくたって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管你已无法看清未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi ta ga mi e na ku ta 't te</span></p><p begin="00:33.795" end="00:41.299" itunes:key="L10636">僕が照らすから まだ消えないでよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也会为你照亮前路 请别消失于世间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ga te ra su ka ra ma da ki e na i de yo</span></p><p begin="00:44.129" end="00:48.794" itunes:key="L10637">春を待つ声が ひらひら響いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等待着暖春到来的声音在沙沙作响</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ru wo ma tsu ko e ga hi ra hi ra hi bi i te</span></p><p begin="00:48.804" end="00:50.904" itunes:key="L10638">虚空を舞ってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我神游虚空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ku u wo ma 't te ru</span></p><p begin="00:50.914" end="00:57.497" itunes:key="L10639">白雪のように 花のように ただ儚く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似白雪一般 似花朵一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ra yu ki no yo u ni ha na no yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:57.800" end="01:00.771" itunes:key="L10640">溶けてゆく時の中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在不断融化的时间中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ke te yu ku to ki no na ka</span></p><p begin="01:00.781" end="01:04.777" itunes:key="L10641">交わした温もりが冷めたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若我们交织的温暖冷却</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa shi ta nu ku mo ri ga sa me ta ra</span></p><p begin="01:04.787" end="01:12.462" itunes:key="L10642">そんなあなたを春風が攫ってく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">春风便会将你掠去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na a na ta wo ha ru ka ze ga sa ra 't te ku</span></p><p begin="01:23.031" end="01:25.399" itunes:key="L10643">少しの別れだと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你强撑笑意跟我说</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ko shi no wa ka re da to</span></p><p begin="01:25.409" end="01:29.584" itunes:key="L10644">作り笑うあなたが言った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这不过是短暂的分别</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ku ri wa ra u a na ta ga i 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:29.874" end="01:35.488" itunes:key="L10645">今に途切れそうな 息が白む<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在 你快停下的呼吸尽显白皙</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma ni to gi re so u na i ki ga shi ra mu</span></p><p begin="01:36.580" end="01:43.396" itunes:key="L10646">痩せ細る手を握り返す 力も脆弱になってく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你回握着我的瘦弱细小的双手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya se ho so ru te no ni gi ri ka e su</span></p><p begin="01:43.676" end="01:49.585" itunes:key="L10647">この部屋だけは 時が止まればいいのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果时间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no he ya da ke wa</span></p><p begin="01:49.995" end="01:51.323" itunes:key="L10648">朝が来れば大抵安堵<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不知从何时起 渐渐无法迈步</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu shi ka a ru ke na ku na 't te</span></p><p begin="01:51.333" end="01:52.423" itunes:key="L10649">時が去った今<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu shi ka a ru ke na ku na 't te</span></p><p begin="01:52.433" end="01:54.157" itunes:key="L10650">隣に立つ貴方はもう居ないから</p><p begin="01:54.167" end="01:55.589" itunes:key="L10651">温もり宛てがって どうにか</p><p begin="01:55.599" end="01:57.116" itunes:key="L10652">なるものじゃないけど 傍に居たいから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无力说话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na se na ku na 't te</span></p><p begin="01:57.026" end="02:02.586" itunes:key="L10653">いつかまた同じ場所で逢おうって そよいだ風<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na se na ku na 't te</span></p><p begin="02:02.753" end="02:07.120" itunes:key="L10654">唯一つだけのその命は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这仅此唯一的生命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da hi to tsu da ke no so no i no chi wa</span></p><p begin="02:07.130" end="02:10.177" itunes:key="L10655">きっと巡り巡ってく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">定会几经轮回</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to me gu ri me gu 't te ku</span></p><p begin="02:10.187" end="02:16.114" itunes:key="L10656">その度出逢って同じように 恋をしてゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们辗转重逢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ta bi de a 't te</span></p><p begin="02:16.712" end="02:20.602" itunes:key="L10657">「ロマンチックだね。」って笑うのは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">笑着说“真浪漫啊”的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ro ma n chi 'k ku da ne 」</span></p><p begin="02:20.612" end="02:23.593" itunes:key="L10658">褪せたフィルムの中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而那已尘封在了泛黄胶卷中</span></p><p begin="02:23.603" end="02:31.351" itunes:key="L10659">並ぶ二人が 透明に変わってく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并肩你我 渐渐变得透明</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ra bu fu ta ri ga to u me i ni ka wa 't te ku</span></p><p begin="02:48.851" end="02:52.080" itunes:key="L10660">朝、目が覚めたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当早晨醒来 便会察觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a sa me ga sa me ta ra</span></p><p begin="02:52.090" end="02:56.543" itunes:key="L10661">全てが夢であってさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一切 都只是一场梦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su be te ga yu me de a 't te sa</span></p><p begin="02:56.553" end="03:01.369" itunes:key="L10662">隣であなたが笑っていたらな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我身边 其实还有着绽放笑容的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to na ri de a na ta ga wa ra 't te i ta ra na</span></p><p begin="03:01.866" end="03:05.014" itunes:key="L10663">そんな願いも雪消と去って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我这样的心愿 与雪一同消融</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na ne ga i mo yu ki ke to sa 't te</span></p><p begin="03:05.424" end="03:08.189" itunes:key="L10664">春の匂いがする<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">春天就要来了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ru no ni o i ga su ru</span></p><p begin="03:08.848" end="03:13.746" itunes:key="L10665">華やぐ季節に あなたはいないのね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这万物复苏的季节 身边却没有了你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na ya gu ki se tsu ni a na ta wa i na i no ne</span></p><p begin="03:18.214" end="03:22.952" itunes:key="L10666">春を待つ声が ひらひら響いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等待着暖春到来的声音在沙沙作响</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ru wo ma tsu ko e ga hi ra hi ra hi bi i te</span></p><p begin="03:22.962" end="03:25.328" itunes:key="L10667">虚空を舞ってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我神游虚空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ku u wo ma 't te ru</span></p><p begin="03:25.338" end="03:31.820" itunes:key="L10668">白雪のように 花のように ただ儚く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似白雪一般 似花朵一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ra yu ki no yo u ni ha na no yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:32.135" end="03:34.802" itunes:key="L10669">溶けてゆく時の中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在不断融化的时间中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ke te yu ku to ki no na ka</span></p><p begin="03:34.912" end="03:39.381" itunes:key="L10670">交わした温もりが冷めたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若我们交织的温暖冷却</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa shi ta nu ku mo ri ga sa me ta ra</span></p><p begin="03:39.391" end="03:46.563" itunes:key="L10671">そんなあなたを春風が攫ってく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">春风便会将你掠去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na a na ta wo ha ru ka ze ga sa ra 't te ku</span></p></div></body></tt>